ou_reading":"m-mother-暢"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-007","source_id":"s-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou-ws1566494","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p002","quote":"初，后嘗於室內，忽見庭前昌蒲生花，光彩照灼，非世中所有。后驚視，謂侍者曰：「汝見不？」對曰：「不見。」后曰：「嘗聞見者當富貴。」因遽取吞之。是月產高祖。將產之夜，后見庭內若有衣冠陪列焉。次生衡陽宣王暢、義興昭長公主令嫕。宋泰始七年，殂于秣陵縣同夏里舍，葬武進縣東城里山。天監元年五月甲辰，追上尊號爲皇后。諡曰獻。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p002:m0099","object_person_reference_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p002:r0002","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p002","surface":"次生衡陽宣王暢","start":93,"end":100}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"原傳分列五名所生子女。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-liang021-wangfen-family-children-father-暢","subject_person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AE","object_person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_A","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"次生衡陽宣王暢","liang021_fen_reading":"children-father-暢","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing-ws2060595","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001","quote":"梁文獻張皇后諱尚柔，范陽方城人也。父穆之娶文帝從姑而生后。后以宋元嘉中嬪於文帝，生長沙宣武王懿、永陽昭王敷，次生武帝。方孕，忽見庭前昌蒲花，光采非常，驚報，侍者皆云不見。后曰：「常聞見昌蒲花者當富貴。」因取吞之，是月生武帝。將產之夕，后見庭內若有衣冠陪列焉。次生衡陽宣王暢、義興昭長公主令嫕。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0135","object_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:r0037"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"承「嬪於文帝，生」與其後兩處「次生」所列子女，文帝即順之。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-liang021-wangfen-family-children-mother-暢","subject_person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AE","object_person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru_*****AA","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"次生衡陽宣王暢","liang021_fen_reading":"children-mother-暢"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-na