s-nanqishu-045-daosheng-complete-ws2273185"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001","text":"梁文獻張皇后諱尚柔，范陽方城人也。父穆之娶文帝從姑而生后。后以宋元嘉中嬪於文帝，生長沙宣武王懿、永陽昭王敷，次生武帝。方孕，忽見庭前昌蒲花，光采非常，驚報，侍者皆云不見。后曰：「常聞見昌蒲花者當富貴。」因取吞之，是月生武帝。將產之夕，后見庭內若有衣冠陪列焉。次生衡陽宣王暢、義興昭長公主令嫕。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0007","surface":"尚柔","start":7,"end":9,"person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru_*****AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0018","surface":"穆之","start":18,"end":20,"person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru_*****A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:u0023","surface":"從姑","start":23,"end":25,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"文帝從姑即尚柔母，父系中間世代未列。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0046","surface":"懿","start":46,"end":47,"person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0052","surface":"敷","start":52,"end":53,"person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AD","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:u0078","surface":"侍者","start":78,"end":80,"person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"傳內未具名的侍者。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0135","surface":"暢","start":135,"end":136,"person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AE","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0143","surface":"令嫕","start":143,"end":145,"person_id":"qvt_eq1_lcf_AB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2060595,"source_layer":"received_biograph